{"title":"2021 CEMC TUC Problems/Practice Relay Problem 1","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Practice_Relay_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>What is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/3/7a38b63b750e6b9f5b6893c45535b7652de618e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 + 0 + 2 + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"105\" height=\"15\" />?\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Practice_Relay_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/c/afc34487cf8f1875e61562916731729d0cd54ffe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2 + 0 + 2 + 1 = 2 + 2 + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"201\" height=\"15\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/8/6/3866badf416d45e3af6ed15abad36b2a4aead8d3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=4 + 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"61\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/c/26c09a24ccf0b401c3b55d319d631e6d9415d71b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\boxed{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"41\" height=\"25\" />\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_TUC\" title=\"2021 CEMC TUC\">2021 CEMC TUC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2