=\"2021 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay B Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Relay B 3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_B_Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay B Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">Relay B 4</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_C_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay C Problem 1 (page does not exist)\">Relay C 1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_C_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay C Problem 2 (page does not exist)\">Relay C 2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_C_Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay C Problem 3 (page does not exist)\">Relay C 3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Relay_C_Problem_4&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2021 CEMC TUC Problems/Relay C Problem 4 (page does not exist)\">Relay C 4</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=CEMC_Team_Up_Challenge\" title=\"CEMC Team Up Challenge\">CEMC Team Up Challenge</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2021_CEMC_TUC_Problems/Practice_Relay_Problem_1&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>It can be quite frustrating to add 4 numbers. Let's make 2,0, and 1 roots of the polynomal <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/6/c96dd6ec1dc4ad7520fbdc78fcdbec9edd068d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"37\" height=\"20\" />: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/c/26c68aa0764e210040ee42297a1e9eabb0d8d06d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=x(x-1)(x-2)^{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"191\" height=\"21\" />. Expand: <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/e/34ebeb10a5f054025d7fe43c25ee06d39d804730.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$f(x)=x^{4}-5x^{3}+8x^{2}-4{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"219\" height=\"21\" />. Now, apply <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Vieta%27s_formulas\" title=\"Vieta&#39;s formulas\">Vieta's formulas</a> and get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/b/4ebe75f4cbff958007647ee48e94691dc0389f7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-\\frac{b}{a}=-\\frac{-5}{1}=5 \\rightarrow =\\boxed{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"191\" height=\"39\" />\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018063443\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.033 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.047 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 99/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2963/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 246/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 1524/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   14.242      1 Template:CEMC_TUC_box\n100.00%   14.242      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:35663:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018063443 and revision id 281827. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}